[["page","lines",0],{"text":"Page 6 of 14Oberoi et al. BMC Medical Research Methodology (2022) 22:64","fontSize":8,"x":56.693511967000006,"y":31.329520507999973,"width":481.967993648,"height":8.519999999999982}]
[["page","lines",1],{"text":"centre). (Quote 1.2a, Table 1). Clinicians also felt that","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.692901611,"y":522.64778711,"width":233.86524000000006,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",2],{"text":"offering patients this study and allowing them the choice","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.69290161100001,"y":534.6429871099999,"width":233.82702,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",3],{"text":"to participate would give them a say in their follow-up","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.69290161100001,"y":546.63818711,"width":233.86523999625626,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",4],{"text":"care. This additional power in the doctor-patient rela-","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.69290161100001,"y":558.6333871100001,"width":233.85841030300003,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",5],{"text":"tionship might be useful for their overall wellbeing. One","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.692901611,"y":570.6478023689999,"width":233.8858199962564,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",6],{"text":"of the participants mentioned that the usefulness of the","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.692901611,"y":582.643002369,"width":233.85347999251294,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",7],{"text":"study was nested in its patient-centred-care model. She","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.692901611,"y":594.638202369,"width":233.88582000000005,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",8],{"text":"added that at times the actual care is lost during the","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.692901611,"y":606.633402369,"width":233.88483999625637,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",9],{"text":"provision of care and having a real conversation with","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.692901611,"y":618.628602369,"width":233.83682000000002,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",10],{"text":"patients to understand how they are coping with their ill-","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.692901611,"y":630.623802369,"width":233.85841030299994,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",11],{"text":"ness was a step in the right direction. Lastly, participants","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.692901611,"y":642.6476955569999,"width":233.8750399962564,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",12],{"text":"also felt that the study was novel and interesting. It would","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.692901611,"y":654.642895557,"width":233.86034000000004,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",13],{"text":"facilitate the healthcare professionals’ understanding of","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.692901611,"y":666.6380955569999,"width":233.85936000000012,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",14],{"text":"patients’ perspectives of their discharge and follow-up","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.692901611,"y":678.633295557,"width":233.87895999251273,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",15],{"text":"care (Quote 1.3a, Quote 1.4a, Table 1).","fontSize":9.8,"x":56.692901611,"y":690.628495557,"width":156.5040399925128,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",16],{"text":"b. The study is inclusive One participant stated that the","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.72110161100005,"y":522.6270989968,"width":233.86621640340007,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",17],{"text":"study was inclusive of all patients that may be interested","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.7211016110001,"y":534.6222989967999,"width":233.8368199962564,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",18],{"text":"in participating, regardless of what treatment they have","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.7211016110001,"y":546.6174989967999,"width":233.85935999251296,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",19],{"text":"received or for how long. Similar views were echoed by","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.7211016110001,"y":558.6126989968,"width":233.82505999251293,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",20],{"text":"other participants as well. One of them believed that","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.7211016110001,"y":570.6078989968,"width":233.87699999999995,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",21],{"text":"patients would be flattered to be invited to this study, as it","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.7211016110001,"y":582.6030989968,"width":233.8936599887693,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",22],{"text":"was a way for them to participate in their own follow–up","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.7211016110001,"y":594.5982989967999,"width":233.84465999251267,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",23],{"text":"care. Another participant was impressed with the broad","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.7211016110001,"y":606.5934989968,"width":233.85641999625648,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",24],{"text":"inclusion criteria and was happy that the study was avail-","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.7211016110001,"y":618.5886989968001,"width":233.861704443,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",25],{"text":"able and accessible to all breast cancer patients (Quote","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.724395751,"y":630.6476955569999,"width":233.88581999999985,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",26],{"text":"1.1b, Table 1).","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.724395751,"y":642.642895557,"width":56.614599999999996,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",27],{"text":"II. Simplicity of the methods","fontSize":9.199999809,"x":304.724395751,"y":679.747703378,"width":105.459597810567,"height":9.199999809000019}]
[["page","lines",28],{"text":"Overall, OP’s expressed the general consensus","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.724395751,"y":691.1477031869999,"width":233.84465999999998,"height":9.800000000000068}]
[["page","lines",29],{"text":"that recruitment methods were simple and very","fontSize":9.8,"x":304.724395751,"y":703.142903187,"width":233.87602000000015,"height":9.799999999999955}]
[["page","lines",30],{"text":"Table 1 (continued)","fontSize":9,"x":56.692901611,"y":86.33261376999997,"width":74.898,"height":9}]
[["page","lines",31],{"text":"3. suggestions for improvement a. Combination of electronic and paper letter 3.1 a “And I agree, have it there and then if I want to print out seven copies","fontSize":8,"x":56.692901611,"y":104.96597558600001,"width":481.49280000152794,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",32],{"text":"and have it in my binder that helps me, well, off I go, right. You shouldn’t","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":113.96597558600001,"width":215.16400002441594,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",33],{"text":"provide those, people can print them themselves if they need.” Participant","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":122.96597558600001,"width":219.26880000152812,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",34],{"text":"4, Rad onc, tertiary cancer centre","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":131.965975586,"width":104.0304000000001,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",35],{"text":"3.2 a “Our patient department is all in one very tiny but all in one area.","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":140.965975586,"width":209.539999995416,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",36],{"text":"So having a paper letter to give to patients I think in some ways is quite","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":149.965975586,"width":212.132000001528,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",37],{"text":"practical. There tends to be less use of shared drive access to forms here so","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":158.965975586,"width":220.00400000152797,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",38],{"text":"if you were going to use that as a place to store something on the shared","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":167.965975586,"width":217.69200000152796,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",39],{"text":"drive, that would have to be really well communicated” Participant 7,","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":176.965975586,"width":207.7416000000003,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",40],{"text":"medical oncologist,regional cancer centre","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":185.965975586,"width":133.37439999999998,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",41],{"text":"b. support for clinicians 3.1 b “I think she would be on board for this because she does a lot of the","fontSize":8,"x":164.31690161099996,"y":198.06197558600002,"width":370.0304000000001,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",42],{"text":"survivorship here anyways. And I think would be the one that gets you a","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":207.06197558600002,"width":214.85999999847206,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",43],{"text":"lot of patients” Participant 2, medical oncologist, regional cancer centre","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":216.06197558600002,"width":222.7600000000001,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",44],{"text":"3.2b “And I think even just a short letter for them with – even with just the","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":225.06197558600002,"width":219.09199999389602,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",45],{"text":"eligibility criteria and then they could just remind us of it.” Participant 5,","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":234.06197558600002,"width":213.64400000915225,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",46],{"text":"med onc, tertiary cancer centre","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":243.06197558600002,"width":96.5584,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",47],{"text":"3.3 b “I’ve had many a times somebody sitting in clinic and they would","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":252.06197558600002,"width":211.2607999999999,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",48],{"text":"identify the potential eligible patients and say doctor, when you’re done","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":261.061975586,"width":214.08399998779998,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",49],{"text":"can I approach the patient? Absolutely, that makes recruitment so much","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":270.061975586,"width":216.96480000000008,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",50],{"text":"more effective and easier.” Participant 12, medical oncologist, tertiary","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":279.061975586,"width":212.388799998472,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",51],{"text":"cancer centre","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490161099996,"y":288.061975586,"width":43.40719999999999,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",52],{"text":"1. Facilitators a. Study is imperative and desperately needed 1.1a “Some of our patients don’t have the family care doctors and there is","fontSize":8,"x":56.69290332299994,"y":300.213975586,"width":478.8120000091521,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",53],{"text":"a lot of anxiety that comes along with the breast cancer patients too. So it","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":309.213975586,"width":221.1159999969442,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",54],{"text":"would be nice to kind of see if it [intervention] makes any kind of difference","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":318.213975586,"width":222.7271999999997,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",55],{"text":"whether you give them a number to call versus a nurse calling, looking at","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":327.213975586,"width":218.84479999999996,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",56],{"text":"the outcomes from that perspective as well too.”","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":336.213975586,"width":143.59760000000006,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",57],{"text":"Participant 2, medical oncologist, regional cancer centre","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":345.213975586,"width":178.0936000015281,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",58],{"text":"1.2a “Just giving them an opportunity to participate in the study which","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":354.213975586,"width":212.52559999083996,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",59],{"text":"would perhaps change their perception of what happens at the end of","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":363.213975586,"width":211.22240000152806,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",60],{"text":"care. I think it’s really quite valuable because I hear and I see on their faces","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":372.213975586,"width":219.36319999694388,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",61],{"text":"a great deal of fear of the unknown and comfort with what they have.”‑","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":381.213975586,"width":214.37599999999998,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",62],{"text":"Participant 11, Nurse practitioner, tertiary cancer centre","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":390.213975586,"width":175.04480000000012,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",63],{"text":"1.3a “Well and ultimately the study itself, you know, it is certainly novel","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":399.213975586,"width":209.50000000610396,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",64],{"text":"and interesting to understand what’s the patient’s perception in terms","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":408.213975586,"width":209.07679999083996,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",65],{"text":"of follow-up care, so that the question that the study question is very","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":417.213975586,"width":204.72399999999993,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",66],{"text":"relevant and very topical.”","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":426.213975586,"width":77.07839999999999,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",67],{"text":"Participant 12, medical oncologist, tertiary care centre","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":435.213975586,"width":170.83759999847206,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",68],{"text":"1.4a “What appeals, I don’t know, the recruitment process seems to be","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":444.213975586,"width":221.9400000106799,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",69],{"text":"relatively straightforward. I guess what appeals to me is we are really","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":453.213975586,"width":216.75680000152806,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",70],{"text":"looking forward to – looks like finally we’re going to be able to get","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":462.213975586,"width":209.98879999694395,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",71],{"text":"some clinical trials going in the community centres and so we’re all","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":471.213975586,"width":212.90880000000016,"height":8}]
[["page","lines",72],{"text":"for research.”","fontSize":8,"x":317.08490332299993,"y":480.213975586,"width":40.039999999999964,"height":8}]
